{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"59d36971028badb3ff796b55f9ab57f0a5bb7ea8d0366f4bf696da211a4a2c3c"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:05b2cde5e6acac08dd6f50b3de4be827a026ea055c59e0145b3f134a136ad179","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"United Kingdom","evidence":"[D1:18 | 7:48 pm on 21 May, 2023] Tim: I went to a place in London a few years ago - it was like walking into a Harry Potter movie! I also went on a tour which was amazing. Have you been to any of the real Potter places? I'd love to explore them someday!\n[D13:1 | 1:50 pm on 13 October, 2023] Tim: Hey John! It's been ages since we last talked. Guess what? Last week I went to a Harry Potter conference in the UK - it was incredible! There were so many people who shared the same love of HP as me, it was like a magical family. I felt so inspired and like I got a new lease of life. I love how my passion for fantasy stuff brings me closer to people from all over the world, it's pretty cool.\n[D18:1 | 3:59 pm on 16 November, 2023] Tim: Hey John! Hope you're doing good. Guess what? I went to a castle during my trip to the UK last Friday and it was unbelievable! The architecture and the history were amazing!","itemId":"urn:uuid:a0530485-aa0a-5f2a-99dd-75e50e647e3a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2b49789b2ebc3ca1c9e82b5c1b77811b55fddda040fefd3ce38a2697b1062721","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"which country has Tim visited most frequently in his travels?","referenceAnswer":"UK","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2b49789b2ebc3ca1c9e82b5c1b77811b55fddda040fefd3ce38a2697b1062721"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}